    "number": "Theorem 2",
    "quote": "Assuming that $\\sum_{s=1}^{T-1} \\lVert \\theta^{\\star}_s - \\theta^{\\star}_{s+1}\\rVert_2 \\leq B_T$, the regret of the $\\DLinUCB$ algorithm is bounded for all $\\gamma \\in (0,1)$ and integer $D\\geq 1$, with probability at least $1-\\delta$, by R_T \\leq 2L D B_T + \\frac{4L^3S}{\\lambda} \\frac{\\gamma^{D}}{1-\\gamma} T + 2\\sqrt{2} \\beta_T \\sqrt{dT} \\sqrt{T \\log(1/\\gamma) + \\log(1+ \\frac{L^2}{d\\lambda(1-\\gamma)})}."
   },
